; The Beast Lord's own chain, modelled on the Iron King's maul (data/weapons/IronKingMaul.tres) and
; deliberately its opposite in rhythm. The King is slow and commits; the Lord is quick and closes.
;
;   1. A RAKE. Interruptible and short, the safe opener, the one to stagger.
;   2. A LUNGE. Uninterruptible, and it WARPS three metres onto its target over the wind-up: stepping
;      back does not leave its reach the way it leaves the maul's. The answer is sideways.

